nglish", "review": "THE EDF DEPLOYS", "timestamp_created": 1573748214, "timestamp_updated": 1573748214, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "57151934", "author": {"steamid": "76561198114877963", "personaname": "Torc Mandra", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/torcmandra/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 2434, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1870, "last_played": 1586750022, "avatar": "831b1c71406f140d853cfff5125f96486114ed3d"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great Game", "timestamp_created": 1573726200, "timestamp_updated": 1573726200, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "57143765", "author": {"steamid": "76561197989037443", "personaname": "Bobson", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/BobsonGlove/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 39, "playtime_forever": 23908, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 12220, "last_played": 1783088470, "avatar": "d14bf67fd0a610b0a021c726c77948708131e4c7"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game is like EDF 4.1 but better in almost every way, except the increased seriousness.\n\nThis one has funny moments, like when meeting the aliens that look \"just like humans\" and the hippies that try to make peace with the invaders, but that's about it. \n\nVoice actors are sometimes insufferable. (i.e. the Chief Commander is way too serious and not funny at all. ) \n\nThe weapon balance is still somewhat poor- mostly for Air Raider and Wing Diver. Nearly every vehicle, except the mecha, are weak and useless because the air raider has such powerful weaponry, and Nix robots are also strong. Wing Divers have dragon lances now, which are incredibly strong in close combat. Fencers actually have the most options open to them, but are limited because of the ability to combine a boost and sprint to move incredibly fast, which is more valuable 99% of the time than using two of the same weapon or weapon and shield, etc.", "timestamp_created": 1573707228, "timestamp_updated": 1582497301, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "57136970", "author": {"steamid": "76561198119597981", "personaname": "SoundBeat", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/SoundBeat/", "num_games_owned": 520, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 14446, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3721, "last_played": 1695925040, "avatar": "0244904b8ec48f9e0355506d7bd5cd953385f20d"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game is perfect for some dumb fun and if you dont mind the grind for armor (Health) and weapons ^^", "timestamp_created": 1573693439, "timestamp_updated": 1573693439, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "57080915", "author": {"steamid": "76561197970573878", "personaname": "SgtJackson", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.c